  "description": "Wrapper for Esri's File Geodatabase API (v1.5.5). It is a foundational dependency for ThinkGeo.FileGeoDatabase and is not intended to be referenced directly by application projects.\n\nIncludes:\n- Esri.FileGDBAPI.dll managed wrapper, v1.5.5.330 (net48 and netstandard2.1)\n- FileGDBAPI.dll native runtime, v1.5.5.330 (Apache 2.0, sourced from https://github.com/Esri/file-geodatabase-api)\n\nSupported Platform: Windows x64. Minimum OS: Windows 10 / Windows Server 2016.\n\nNo separate ArcGIS or File Geodatabase API install is required — the native DLL ships inside this NuGet package and is deployed app-locally. See README.md inside the package for details.",
